cherrycherrysquarewave-by-funnycurlycatcodefactory (1.0-0ddebs3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Changes prepared with Claude Opus 5.5
  * debian/control : ${shlibs:Depends} was empty (no libc6), added the
    missing libgl1 dependency, removed the unneeded libsdl1.2-dev
    build dependency and Multi-Arch, wrote a real description
  * debian/rules, debian/shlibs-stub.c, debian/clean : compute the shlibs
    on a stub with the same libc and libm imports, dpkg-shlibdeps cannot
    read the executable (no section header table)
  * debian/copyright : Source is the scene.org release, credit muffintrap
  * debian/README.source : explain the content of the orig tarball, the
    dependencies and the build origin of the executable
  * debian/resources/*.desktop : 4k intro instead of demo, added Keywords
    and a French comment
  * debian/scripts : fixed the description shown by --help
  * debian/*.6.md : documented --help and the two upstream versions,
    regenerated the manual page
  * debian/*.lintian-overrides : override the pandoc groff-message, the
    hardening tags of the precompiled executable and the duplicate word
    of the title

